  "description": "VIHQAF crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C60 H80 N4 O32 Tb4,2(C4 H10 O1). From the CIF bond table, Tb1 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb2 (Tb) has 9 O neighbors; Tb1A (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb2A (Tb) has 9 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.364-3.719 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 85.78-102.24°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C68H100N4O34Tb4. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 8 OAc (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
